{"id":"2ff9f25cca69b423","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-truth.md","title":"Truth","display":"df-truth — Truth","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-truth","aliases":["58-df-truth","Truth (Logic)"],"display":"df-truth — Truth","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-truth</span><span>Truth (Logic)</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth — Truth"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\phi\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\phi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> (structure predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> (formula set; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\phi)\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\phi)\\)</span> (free-variable set; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\)</span> (assignment predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span> (selected valuation and satisfaction recursion; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TruthIn}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TruthIn}_S\\)</span> (truth-in-a-structure predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{TruthIn}_S(\\mathcal M,\\phi,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\n\\operatorname{Sat}(\\phi,s))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{TruthIn}_S(\\mathcal M,\\phi,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathcal L}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\to\n\\operatorname{Sat}(\\phi,s))\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Tarski's truth definition: truth in a structure is defined recursively on formula complexity</li>\n<li>Satisfaction is the relation between structures, formulas, and assignments; truth is its restriction to sentences. The valuation and satisfaction functions are explicit witnesses, so no unselected <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> relation remains in the defining formula.</li>\n<li>Definable set: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{a \\in M^n : \\mathcal{M} \\models \\phi(a)\\}\">\\(\\{a \\in M^n : \\mathcal{M} \\models \\phi(a)\\}\\)</span>; type-definable = intersection of definables</li>\n<li>Quantifier clauses belong to the recursive definition of satisfaction and are not repeated here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Enderton, A Mathematical Introduction to Logic</li>\n<li>Marker, Model Theory: An Introduction</li>\n<li>Hodges, Model Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)$ (structure predicate; see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","statu